A transfer remains atomic when its postings have different dates.

========== API ==========

totalHistory({ accounts: ['Assets:'], dateBasis: 'transaction' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
2024-01-02 Internal transfer
  Assets:Destination  10 SEK
  Assets:Source  -10 SEK ; [2024-01-01]

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-02",
    "amount": "0",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  }
]
